Description: Keep the installed JACK examples on PipeWire's JACK implementation
 The examples link against PipeWire's JACK extensions in the build tree.
 Preserve that library choice after installation without changing the system
 JACK provider or the resolution of other installed tests. The video example
 must also wait for an input before reading a whole image: an unconnected
 JACK port supplies only an audio-sized silence buffer.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-23

--- a/pipewire-jack/src/meson.build
+++ b/pipewire-jack/src/meson.build
@@ -108,6 +108,7 @@
     install_dir : installed_tests_execdir / 'examples' / 'jack',
     dependencies : [sdl_dep, mathlib],
     link_with: pipewire_jack,
+    install_rpath : libjack_path,
   )
 endif
 executable('ump-source',
